   "body": "Fixed on a fork branch: `fix/2755-led-format-tokens` (head `b20f17d5`, on upstream `6eb510f7`) — the tokens trend's tooltip says tokens the page's way.\n\n**Root cause.** `internal/gui/assets/app.js`'s `ledFormatLong` sent the token branch through `ledNum` (a thousand-separated count, `15,522`) while `ledFormat` beside it already sends tokens through `fmtN` — and the usage plugin's own tip (`plugins/usage/page.js`) formats too. The tooltip's rows, its sums and the ranking all read `ledFormatLong`.\n\n**Change.** the token branch goes through `fmtN` — `15.5K`, or `1.6 万` with Settings' 万/亿 units on. The cost and speed branches and the calls count are as they were.\n\n**Verified.** Red: `the new case in `usage-ttft-rounding.test.cjs` (playwright 1.62.1 in a container) against base assets` → `AssertionError: tokens said the page's way: 15,522 (want 15.5K)`\nGreen: `same command → 8/8 (chromium + webkit, en/zh); `TestCoreScriptBudget` unchanged` → `ℹ pass 8, fail 0`\n\nFull `go test -tags nogui ./...` over round 27's branches: 70 packages ok, 5 red (edit `TestWriteAtomicReadOnlyHardLink`, gateway's five, plugin `TestPluginSOCKSProxy`, provider's synctest fatal in `TestUnreadLoginsWriteErrorsKeepCredentials`, testenv `TestProgram`) — every one of them reproduces identically at base `6eb510f7` in this environment (umask 0027), so none is from this change.\n\nBranch: https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/tree/fix/2755-led-format-tokens — no PR opened, this repo takes no external PRs; say the word if you'd rather have the patch inline here.",
